{"seq":1,"slug":"class-loading-mechanism","title":"Java 类加载机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/jvm-internals/class-loading-mechanism","wordCount":1046,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"java-类加载机制\">Java 类加载机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Java 的类加载机制是 JVM 将 <code>.class</code> 字节码文件加载到内存并转换为 <code>java.lang.Class</code> 对象的过程。这一机制采用了委托模型（Delegation Model）和延迟加载策略，是 Java 实现平台无关性、动态扩展和模块隔离的基础。理解类加载的全过程，对于排查 ClassNotFoundException、NoClassDefFoundError 以及设计插件系统至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[加载 Loading] --&gt; B[验证 Verification]&#10;    B --&gt; C[准备 Preparation]&#10;    C --&gt; D[解析 Resolution]&#10;    D --&gt; E[初始化 Initialization]&#10;    E --&gt; F[使用 Using]&#10;    F --&gt; G[卸载 Unloading]&#10;    subgraph 连接阶段 Linking&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[加载 Loading] --&gt; B[验证 Verification]\n    B --&gt; C[准备 Preparation]\n    C --&gt; D[解析 Resolution]\n    D --&gt; E[初始化 Initialization]\n    E --&gt; F[使用 Using]\n    F --&gt; G[卸载 Unloading]\n    subgraph 连接阶段 Linking\n        B\n        C\n        D\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>关键操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加载</td>\n<td>读取字节码</td>\n<td>通过全限定名获取二进制流，创建 Class 对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证</td>\n<td>安全检查</td>\n<td>文件格式、元数据、字节码、符号引用验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准备</td>\n<td>分配内存</td>\n<td>为静态变量分配内存并设零值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析</td>\n<td>符号引用转直接引用</td>\n<td>类、字段、方法的符号引用解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初始化</td>\n<td>执行类构造器</td>\n<td>执行 <code>&lt;clinit&gt;</code> 方法，静态块和静态变量赋值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>类加载遵循<strong>按需加载</strong>——JVM 规范只要求在首次主动使用时初始化类，而非启动时加载所有类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双亲委派模型\">双亲委派模型</h2><p>双亲委派模型（Parent Delegation Model）是 Java 类加载器的标准工作方式：当一个类加载器收到加载请求时，它首先将请求委托给父加载器，只有当父加载器无法完成加载时，才由自己来加载。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"protected Class&lt;?&gt; loadClass(String name, boolean resolve) throws ClassNotFoundException {&#10;    synchronized (getClassLoadingLock(name)) {&#10;        Class&lt;?&gt; c = findLoadedClass(name);&#10;        if (c == null) {&#10;            try {&#10;                if (parent != null) {&#10;                    c = parent.loadClass(name, false);&#10;                } else {&#10;                    c = findBootstrapClassOrNull(name);&#10;                }&#10;            } catch (ClassNotFoundException e) {&#10;            }&#10;            if (c == null) {&#10;                c = findClass(name);&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        if (resolve) {&#10;            resolveClass(c);&#10;        }&#10;        return c;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protected</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Class</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;?></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String name, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resolve) throws ClassNotFoundException {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    synchronized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getClassLoadingLock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Class&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findLoadedClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (parent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findBootstrapClassOrNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ClassNotFoundException </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (resolve) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            resolveClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph BT&#10;    A[应用类加载器 Application] --&gt; B[扩展类加载器 Extension/Platform]&#10;    B --&gt; C[启动类加载器 Bootstrap]&#10;    D[自定义类加载器] --&gt; A&#10;    C -.-&gt;|rt.jar, java.base| C&#10;    B -.-&gt;|ext/*.jar, jdk.* modules| B&#10;    A -.-&gt;|classpath, app modules| A\">graph BT\n    A[应用类加载器 Application] --&gt; B[扩展类加载器 Extension/Platform]\n    B --&gt; C[启动类加载器 Bootstrap]\n    D[自定义类加载器] --&gt; A\n    C -.-&gt;|rt.jar, java.base| C\n    B -.-&gt;|ext/*.jar, jdk.* modules| B\n    A -.-&gt;|classpath, app modules| A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类加载器</th>\n<th>Java 8</th>\n<th>Java 9+</th>\n<th>加载范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bootstrap</td>\n<td>C++ 实现</td>\n<td>C++ 实现</td>\n<td>java.base 等核心模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Extension</td>\n<td>ExtClassLoader</td>\n<td>PlatformClassLoader</td>\n<td>jdk.* 平台模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Application</td>\n<td>AppClassLoader</td>\n<td>AppClassLoader</td>\n<td>应用 classpath</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>双亲委派的价值</strong>：防止核心类被篡改（如自定义 <code>java.lang.String</code> 不会被加载），保证类的唯一性——同一个类由同一个加载器加载时才是同一个类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"打破双亲委派\">打破双亲委派</h2><p>某些场景需要打破双亲委派的限制。最典型的是 SPI（Service Provider Interface）机制和 Web 容器中的类隔离。</p>\n<p><strong>SPI 与线程上下文类加载器</strong>：JDBC 驱动加载是经典案例——<code>DriverManager</code> 在 Bootstrap 加载器加载，但需要加载 classpath 上的驱动实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// java.sql.DriverManager 使用 ServiceLoader 加载驱动&#10;// ServiceLoader 内部使用线程上下文类加载器&#10;ServiceLoader&lt;Driver&gt; loadedDrivers = ServiceLoader.load(Driver.class);&#10;&#10;// 设置线程上下文类加载器&#10;Thread.currentThread().setContextClassLoader(customClassLoader);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// java.sql.DriverManager 使用 ServiceLoader 加载驱动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ServiceLoader 内部使用线程上下文类加载器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ServiceLoader&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Driver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> loadedDrivers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ServiceLoader.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Driver.class);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置线程上下文类加载器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Thread.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">currentThread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setContextClassLoader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(customClassLoader);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Web 容器类加载</strong>：Tomcat 等 Web 容器为每个 Web 应用创建独立的类加载器，优先加载 WEB-INF/lib 和 WEB-INF/classes 中的类，实现应用间的类隔离：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Tomcat 的类加载顺序（打破双亲委派）：&#10;// 1. Bootstrap → JVM 核心类&#10;// 2. Web App ClassLoader → WEB-INF/classes, WEB-INF/lib&#10;// 3. Common ClassLoader → Tomcat 共享库&#10;// 4. System ClassLoader → classpath\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Tomcat 的类加载顺序（打破双亲委派）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. Bootstrap → JVM 核心类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. Web App ClassLoader → WEB-INF/classes, WEB-INF/lib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. Common ClassLoader → Tomcat 共享库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 4. System ClassLoader → classpath</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>自定义类加载器</strong>——实现热部署或插件系统：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public class PluginClassLoader extends ClassLoader {&#10;    private final Path pluginDir;&#10;&#10;    public PluginClassLoader(Path pluginDir, ClassLoader parent) {&#10;        super(parent);&#10;        this.pluginDir = pluginDir;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    protected Class&lt;?&gt; findClass(String name) throws ClassNotFoundException {&#10;        try {&#10;            Path classFile = pluginDir.resolve(name.replace(&#39;.&#39;, &#39;/&#39;) + &quot;.class&quot;);&#10;            byte[] bytes = Files.readAllBytes(classFile);&#10;            return defineClass(name, bytes, 0, bytes.length);&#10;        } catch (IOException e) {&#10;            throw new ClassNotFoundException(name, e);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PluginClassLoader</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClassLoader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Path pluginDir;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PluginClassLoader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Path </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pluginDir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ClassLoader </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">parent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pluginDir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pluginDir;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    protected</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Class&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ClassNotFoundException {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Path classFile </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pluginDir.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \".class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] bytes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Files.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readAllBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(classFile);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name, bytes, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bytes.length);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (IOException </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClassNotFoundException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name, e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>委派方式</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准应用</td>\n<td>标准双亲委派</td>\n<td>默认行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPI 驱动加载</td>\n<td>线程上下文加载器</td>\n<td>Thread.setContextClassLoader</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web 容器</td>\n<td>子优先（child-first）</td>\n<td>重写 loadClass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热部署</td>\n<td>每次新建加载器</td>\n<td>丢弃旧 ClassLoader</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSGi</td>\n<td>网状委托</td>\n<td>Bundle ClassLoader</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"类的初始化时机\">类的初始化时机</h2><p>JVM 规范严格定义了类初始化的触发条件（主动使用）。仅以下六种情况会触发类的初始化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public class InitOrder {&#10;    static {&#10;        System.out.println(&quot;InitOrder 初始化&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static final int COMPILE_CONST = 42;&#10;    public static final int RUNTIME_CONST = new Random().nextInt();&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 触发初始化的主动使用：&#10;new InitOrder();                           // 1. new 实例&#10;InitOrder.RUNTIME_CONST;                   // 2. 读取非编译期常量的静态字段&#10;InitOrder.class.getDeclaredMethods();      // 3. 反射调用&#10;// 子类初始化时，父类先初始化                     // 4. 子类初始化&#10;// JVM 启动时的主类                           // 5. main 方法所在类&#10;// MethodHandle 解析                        // 6. 动态语言支持&#10;&#10;// 不触发初始化的被动引用：&#10;InitOrder.COMPILE_CONST;                   // 编译期常量，不触发&#10;InitOrder[] arr = new InitOrder[10];       // 数组创建，不触发\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InitOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"InitOrder 初始化\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COMPILE_CONST </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RUNTIME_CONST </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nextInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 触发初始化的主动使用：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InitOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();                           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. new 实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InitOrder.RUNTIME_CONST;                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 读取非编译期常量的静态字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InitOrder.class.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getDeclaredMethods</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 反射调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 子类初始化时，父类先初始化                     // 4. 子类初始化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// JVM 启动时的主类                           // 5. main 方法所在类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// MethodHandle 解析                        // 6. 动态语言支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不触发初始化的被动引用：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InitOrder.COMPILE_CONST;                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 编译期常量，不触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">InitOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] arr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> InitOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 数组创建，不触发</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>静态块与静态变量的执行顺序</strong>：<code>&lt;clinit&gt;</code> 方法按照源代码中静态语句出现的先后顺序执行。JVM 保证 <code>&lt;clinit&gt;</code> 方法在多线程环境下只执行一次：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public class Singleton {&#10;    private static final Singleton INSTANCE = new Singleton();&#10;&#10;    private Singleton() {}&#10;&#10;    public static Singleton getInstance() {&#10;        return INSTANCE;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Singleton</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Singleton INSTANCE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Singleton</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Singleton</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Singleton </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INSTANCE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这正是基于类加载机制实现线程安全单例的原理——<code>&lt;clinit&gt;</code> 的线程安全由 JVM 保证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见问题诊断\">常见问题诊断</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>排查方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ClassNotFoundException</td>\n<td>类在 classpath 中不存在</td>\n<td>检查依赖、包名、打包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NoClassDefFoundError</td>\n<td>类存在但初始化失败</td>\n<td>检查静态块、静态字段初始化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LinkageError</td>\n<td>类已被不同加载器加载</td>\n<td>类加载器冲突，检查容器隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ClassCastException</td>\n<td>不同加载器的同名类</td>\n<td>确保同一个类加载器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UnsupportedClassVersionError</td>\n<td>class 版本高于 JVM</td>\n<td>升级 JVM 或降低编译目标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>诊断工具</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 查看类的加载器链&#10;Class&lt;?&gt; clazz = MyClass.class;&#10;ClassLoader loader = clazz.getClassLoader();&#10;while (loader != null) {&#10;    System.out.println(loader);&#10;    loader = loader.getParent();&#10;}&#10;&#10;// JVM 启动参数&#10;// -verbose:class 打印所有类的加载信息&#10;// -XX:+TraceClassLoading 详细跟踪\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 查看类的加载器链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Class&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> clazz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MyClass.class;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ClassLoader loader </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clazz.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getClassLoader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (loader </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(loader);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loader </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loader.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getParent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// JVM 启动参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -verbose:class 打印所有类的加载信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -XX:+TraceClassLoading 详细跟踪</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>类加载经历加载、验证、准备、解析、初始化五个阶段，遵循按需加载原则</li>\n<li>双亲委派模型通过向上委托保证核心类安全和唯一性</li>\n<li>SPI、Web 容器、热部署等场景需要打破双亲委派，常见方式是线程上下文加载器和自定义加载器</li>\n<li>只有六种主动使用会触发类初始化，编译期常量和数组创建不会触发</li>\n<li>利用 <code>&lt;clinit&gt;</code> 的线程安全保证可以实现高效的单例模式</li>\n<li>类加载相关异常（ClassNotFoundException vs NoClassDefFoundError）的根因不同，需要针对性排查</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Java 类加载机制","id":"java-类加载机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"双亲委派模型","id":"双亲委派模型"},{"level":2,"text":"打破双亲委派","id":"打破双亲委派"},{"level":2,"text":"类的初始化时机","id":"类的初始化时机"},{"level":2,"text":"常见问题诊断","id":"常见问题诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Record、Sealed 类与模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/java-core-fundamentals/records-sealed-pattern-matching"},"next":{"title":"JIT 编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/jvm-internals/jit-compilation"}}